				<img height="283" src="img/funkorogashi023_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/SO-TA/funkorogashi/img/funkorogashi023.jpg" --></a><a href="img/funkorogashi024.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/funkorogashi024_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/SO-TA/funkorogashi/img/funkorogashi024.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/funkorogashi025.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/funkorogashi025_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/SO-TA/funkorogashi/img/funkorogashi025.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment"></td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="10">パッケージ</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/funkorogashi026.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/funkorogashi026_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/SO-TA/funkorogashi/img/funkorogashi026.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/funkorogashi027.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/funkorogashi027_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/SO-TA/funkorogashi/img/funkorogashi027.jpg" --></a><a href="img/funkorogashi028.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/funkorogashi028_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/SO-TA/funkorogashi/img/funkorogashi028.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">今回、初めてBOX購入しました。<br />
			公式から1BOX購入で全種そろう旨が宣言されているので安心です。</td></tr>
			<!--
